From 00dd38f6e8904400cef204eeac9b51fb4d1ba386 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 04:07:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unify stage 1-3 stall, counter, crate and facility art to one
 pixel style

Bake each texture to ~6 screen-pixel blocks (block size from its on-screen
scale), lower saturation/contrast with a warm sunset tint, lock colors to the
background palette plus rust red, faded brass and wood browns, and soften the
dense black interior outlines on counters and crates. Texture sizes are kept so
sprite slices and prefab layout are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ntsJJALtT5Yg1ch4vFQ9Q
